$PROBLEM    SYNTHETIC lstparsR test case s23: 26 THETAs, wrapped records
$INPUT      ID TIME AMT DV MDV EVID WT AGE SEX CRCL
$DATA      synthetic_s23.csv IGNORE=@
$PRED
  ; 26 fixed-effect parameters of an invented covariate model
  BASE = THETA(1) + THETA(2) * WT + THETA(3) * AGE
  IPRED = BASE * EXP(ETA(1))
  Y     = IPRED + EPS(1)
$THETA  26*0.5
$OMEGA  0.1 0.1 0.3
$SIGMA  0.03
$ESTIMATION METHOD=1 INTERACTION MAXEVAL=9999 PRINT=5
$COVARIANCE PRINT=E
  
NM-TRAN MESSAGES 
  
 WARNINGS AND ERRORS (IF ANY) FOR PROBLEM    1
             
 (WARNING  2) NM-TRAN INFERS THAT THE DATA ARE POPULATION.
  
